{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_25","type":"agent_message","text":"代码已写入 [4.py](/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/combo_new/seed1852178230/14/4.py)。\n\n实现包含 `main(grid: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray` 和 `generate_input() -> np.ndarray`，为自包含单文件版本。`main()` 按“主图案识别、孔洞提取、碎片旋转匹配+maroon 锁扣对齐、移除标记、读取 red L 箭头并做全局 90° 旋转”的规则求解；`generate_input()` 会随机化网格尺寸、主图案轮廓、可填孔/永久孔、碎片数量与形状、碎片朝向、箭头方向与整体预旋转，并用求解器回验避免退化样例。\n\n已执行并通过题目要求的自检：\n```bash\npython - <<'PY'\nfrom importlib.machinery import SourceFileLoader\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport hashlib\nimport numpy as np\n\np = Path(\"/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/combo_new/seed1852178230/14/4.py\")\nmod = SourceFileLoader(\"new_arc_task\", str(p)).load_module()\nsigs = set()\nfor i in range(100):\n    inp = mod.generate_input()\n    out = mod.main(inp)\n    assert isinstance(inp, np.ndarray)\n    assert isinstance(out, np.ndarray)\n    assert inp.ndim == 2 and max(inp.shape) <= 30\n    assert out.ndim == 2 and max(out.shape) <= 30\n    sigs.add(hashlib.md5(inp.tobytes() + str(inp.shape).encode()).hexdigest())\nprint(\"variants\", len(sigs))\nassert len(sigs) >= 20\nPY\npython -m py_compile \"/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/combo_new/seed1852178230/14/4.py\"\n```\n\n结果为 `variants 100`，并且已清理 `__pycache__`。"}}
